; Pipeline v4 — the new compiler session
; Sprint 40 introduces --v4, a new entry point that will
; progressively replace the old pipeline with a scheduler-driven
; concurrent architecture.

; For now, --v4 delegates everything to the existing pipeline.
; Let's verify it works identically.

; Basic arithmetic
(+ 1 2)

; Define a function
(defn double [x] (* x 2))
(double 21)

; Type inference
/sig double

; ADTs work through the v4 path. (Option/Some/None now ship in the prelude, so
; this tour defines its own Maybe to show deftype without a prelude conflict.)
(deftype (Maybe a) Nada (Just [:a val]))
(Just 42)

; Pattern matching
(defn unwrap-or [opt default]
  (match opt [(Just v) v Nada default]))
(unwrap-or (Just 10) 0)
(unwrap-or Nada 99)

; Modules and imports
/list

; The v4 path runs the same pipeline — identical results,
; but the foundation for concurrent compilation is now in place.
